cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "vsr-mobile: on-device video super-resolution from 270p to 1080p"
abstract: >-
  A causal 1.9M-parameter recurrent student for x4 video super-resolution with a confidence-gated hidden state,
  distilled from BasicVSR++, with quantisation-aware fine-tuning, ONNX, TensorRT INT8 and Core ML exports, and a
  Rust playback pipeline with a frame-time budget.
version: 0.6.0
date-released: 2026-10-14
license: Apache-2.0
